  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></msqrt></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></math> is equal to:"
